# Phase 07 — Attendance, dashboard & reports

## Goal

Gym-timezone attendance check-in, a dashboard fed by real queries, and date-filtered reports that match underlying payment rows.

## Tasks

- Check-in RPC using gym business date with duplicate prevention; today's list; member history.
- Dashboard from real queries: total members, active, expired, expiring soon, today's attendance, today's collections net of reversals, pending dues, recent payments.
- Reports with date filters.
- Test that report totals equal underlying payment rows.

## Done when

- [ ] Check-in uses gym business date; duplicates blocked
- [ ] Today's list and member history work
- [ ] Dashboard metrics come from real queries (not placeholders)
- [ ] Reports filter by date and totals match payment rows
- [ ] Lint, typecheck, and tests pass

Update BUILD_STATUS.md, then stop and wait for me.
